1
00:00:01,850 --> 00:00:06,080
台北木柵　景美溪畔　一條山洞通往山谷
<i>Muzha, Taipei. By the Jingmei River, a tunnel leads into a valley.</i>

2
00:00:09,683 --> 00:00:12,633
世新大學新聞系的武功秘笈
<i>The Secret Manual of Shih Hsin University's Department of Journalism.</i>

3
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:20,270
1956年　報人成舍我在木柵溝子口開山立派
<i>In 1956, newspaperman Cheng She-wo founded the sect at Gouzikou, Muzha.</i>

4
00:00:22,983 --> 00:00:26,593
他傳下總訣：德智兼修　手腦並用
<i>His creed: cultivate virtue and wisdom; use both hands and mind.</i>

5
00:00:29,883 --> 00:00:33,813
1957年3月　實習刊物《小世界》創刊
<i>In March 1957, the student practicum paper Little World was launched.</i>

6
00:00:36,167 --> 00:00:40,667
第一式　採訪：令狐沖的獨孤九劍　專找破綻
<i>Form One, Interviewing: Linghu Chong's Nine Swords of Dugu seek the flaw.</i>

7
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:47,670
第二式　寫作：喬峰的降龍十八掌　招招到位
<i>Form Two, Writing: Qiao Feng's Dragon-Subduing Palms. Every blow lands.</i>

8
00:00:51,183 --> 00:00:55,593
第三式　查證：楊過的玄鐵重劍　重劍無鋒
<i>Form Three, Verification: Yang Guo's heavy iron sword. No edge, all weight.</i>

9
00:00:58,133 --> 00:01:01,843
第四式　編輯：張無忌的乾坤大挪移
<i>Form Four, Editing: Zhang Wuji's Great Shift of Heaven and Earth.</i>

10
00:01:05,750 --> 00:01:08,830
郭靖說：俠之大者　為國為民
<i>Guo Jing said: the greatest heroes serve the nation and its people.</i>

11
00:01:09,530 --> 00:01:12,960
九十歲那年　他仍創辦《台灣立報》
<i>In the year he turned ninety, he still founded the Taiwan Lihpao.</i>

12
00:01:14,750 --> 00:01:18,390
七十年來　這本秘笈一代傳過一代
<i>For seventy years, this manual has passed from generation to generation.</i>

13
00:01:19,090 --> 00:01:23,170
最後一頁永遠空白　留給下一位執筆的人
<i>Its last page is always blank, left for the next one to take up the pen.</i>

14
00:01:25,783 --> 00:01:28,413
風華七十　傳世新章
<i>Seventy radiant years; a new chapter to pass on.</i>
